            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Dear Evgeni,\r\nI will try to create a custom omnifunc or completefunc and register it per my filetype. Since I am not that advanced in Neovim some things are not as obvious to me.\r\nI asked about my case for I assumed that once I stick to the omnifunc or completefunc signiture and return type format Mini.completion will be able to function like a completion popup manager.\r\n\r\nI will try to take small steps practicing with a plaintext file.\r\nWhen browsing through code I found the following buffer variable: `vim.b.minicompletion_disable`.\r\n\r\nWill it disable the mechanism or I need to apply the config you suggested to disable automatic setup. We would need to handle the fallback case as well for it uses the standard keys.\r\n\r\nAll the best,\r\nPawel\r\n",
